flowchart LR
	COUNT["the count line on a normal completion<br/>with replacements made"]
	RENDER["the replacement= field renders the default<br/>as a bare space"]
	HOT["the replacement hot-editable<br/>say to _ for debugging"]
	PASS["the same pass runs over reasoning deltas<br/>when normalizeReasoning is on and over<br/>tool-call arguments when the example patch<br/>enables normalizeToolArguments"]
	EXEMPT["the edit name exempt - raw-marker calls<br/>passing through unnormalized"]
	COUNT --> RENDER
	COUNT --> HOT
	COUNT --> PASS --> EXEMPT
